paragraph\" ><strong>Unexpected Twists:</strong> A unique take on love, identity, and self-discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and Sweet Gameplay:</strong> A <strong>30-60 minute</strong> story-driven experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When science meets romance, expect the unexpected. <strong>Are you ready to reboot your heart?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530660/extras/caa2a4f4006d3571ed2a843e79be79ad.poster.avif?t=1744107763\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530660/extras/caa2a4f4006d3571ed2a843e79be79ad.webm?t=1744107763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530660/extras/caa2a4f4006d3571ed2a843e79be79ad.mp4?t=1744107763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
